const f=/\[(总|备注|附加|改数)\]([^[]*)/g,u=/(?:^|\s)加高(?=\s|$)/,c=s=>String(s??"").replace(/\s+/g," ").trim(),g=s=>{const n=c(s);if(!n)return"";const t={};for(const o of n.matchAll(f)){const i=o[1],a=c(o[2]);a&&!t[i]&&(t[i]=a)}if(t.备注)return t.备注;if(t.附加)return t.附加;const e=[];u.test(n)&&e.push("加高");const r=t.改数||"";return/^\d+$/.test(r)&&Number(r)>0&&e.push(`改数${r}`),e.length>0?e.join(" "):c(n.replace(f," "))};export{g as s};
